WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 12.3 · Partnerships & Ecosystem Building
Ecosystem and partnership mapping

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Map the actors around your issue, then prioritise a few by value and fit.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start from your Module 1 stakeholder map.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Include who can block you, not only who helps.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Choose two or three priorities, each with a next step.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: 16 actors in four groups; five high value; this term, the county education office and the science centre.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a ranked map of potential partners.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
